 "doc": "PROGRAM_OPT feature library (DEV-FEAT). 18 hourly features x {BTC, ETH} + f19 (O1), R1 causal, R2 transforms, E6 hygiene.\nConventions (see CHOICES_FEAT.md):\n - Hour grid t = UTC hour start (ms). A trade is usable at t iff timestamp < t - 5 min. Its 'avail hour'\n   a = ((ts + 5min) // 1h + 1) * 1h is the first grid hour where it is usable. 24h window at t = trades with\n   ts in [t - 24h - 5min, t - 5min) <=> a in [t - 23h, t]; 72h window <=> a in [t - 71h, t].\n - DVOL / Binance kline rows are labelled by candle OPEN time; candle [ts, ts+1h) closes at ts+1h and is usable at t\n   iff ts + 1h <= t. f01(t) = close of DVOL candle with ts = t - 1h (exact, no forward fill).\n - Black-Scholes, r = 0, S = trade index_price, sigma = iv/100, T = (expiry - ts) / (365 d). Deribit BTC/ETH options are\n   inverse (premium in coin): premium USD = price * index_price * amount. Delta = standard BS USD delta N(d1) (call),\n   N(d1) - 1 (put); NO premium adjustment. Vega = S * phi(d1) * sqrt(T) / 100 (USD per 1 vol point per 1 coin).\n - amount = coin units of underlying (contract_size = 1 for all instruments; 'contracts' field is empty in this dump).\n",
